{"server":"cn","storyId":"main_4_level_main_04-03_end","groupId":"main_4","stageId":"main_04-03","title":"人工制冷","storyCode":"4-3","avgTag":"行动后","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_main_04-03_end.txt","sourceHash":"2bc124dfdaa99b533ae5f1a36140f2bb8c7ac8c479ff5bd30b62e427e210c119","bodyAvailable":true,"summaryText":"废城中，陨星小队发现了一支与众不同的整合运动队伍。\n这支队伍正是让气温下降的元凶，而这让霜叶回想起了一个有关雪怪的传闻。","blocks":[{"type":"narration","text":"第三十二关（前）"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_cher_2"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"整合运动","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"动作快！......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰西卡","speakerId":"char_259_Jessica","isRemote":false,"text":"怎么会......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霜叶","speakerId":"char_193_frostl","isRemote":false,"text":"（别出声！）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰西卡","speakerId":"char_259_Jessica","isRemote":false,"text":"（唔——）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霜叶","speakerId":"char_193_frostl","isRemote":false,"text":"（他们还在吗？）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陨星","speakerId":"char_219_meteo","isRemote":false,"text":"（还在......！）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陨星","speakerId":"char_219_meteo","isRemote":false,"text":"（似乎是在找什么东西——）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陨星","speakerId":"char_219_meteo","isRemote":false,"text":"（——有一个整合运动，望向我们这边了！撤回掩体！）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"整合运动成员","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"————"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"整合运动成员","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"是我的错觉吗。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霜叶","speakerId":"char_193_frostl","isRemote":false,"text":"（能不能狙击他们？）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陨星","speakerId":"char_219_meteo","isRemote":false,"text":"（我们与敌人距离太远了......）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陨星","speakerId":"char_219_meteo","isRemote":false,"text":"（自从他们出现以后，爆炸声就停止了......）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陨星","speakerId":"char_219_meteo","isRemote":false,"text":"（他们的站位很分散，我不可能一次性消灭全部三个。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陨星","speakerId":"char_219_meteo","isRemote":false,"text":"（而且那些整合运动的动作，和普通的暴徒有明显的区别。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰西卡","speakerId":"char_259_Jessica","isRemote":false,"text":"（其他整合运动，似乎没有那么厚重的装扮。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陨星","speakerId":"char_219_meteo","isRemote":false,"text":"（没错。可见，一旦轻举妄动，只要有一个活下来、引来更多的暴徒，我们就危险了。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陨星","speakerId":"char_219_meteo","isRemote":false,"text":"（再加上，其中有一个人是术师的装扮，而且正在测试什么的样子。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陨星","speakerId":"char_219_meteo","isRemote":false,"text":"（如果他们同样也有索敌式的法术......）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陨星","speakerId":"char_219_meteo","isRemote":false,"text":"（在我们的位置射出一发弹药，他们完全有可能感觉得到。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霜叶","speakerId":"char_193_frostl","isRemote":false,"text":"（所以结论是不能。明明是三对三，却像是被包围了呢。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陨星","speakerId":"char_219_meteo","isRemote":false,"text":"（有点糟糕。我很讨厌这种感觉。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陨星","speakerId":"char_219_meteo","isRemote":false,"text":"（猎人被更庞大的野兽逼入绝路，不得不藏起来的感觉。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陨星","speakerId":"char_219_meteo","isRemote":false,"text":"（等等，他们似乎在与谁通讯——）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霜叶","speakerId":"char_193_frostl","isRemote":false,"text":"（在这里是听不到内容的。让我去。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陨星","speakerId":"char_219_meteo","isRemote":false,"text":"（不行，现在移动太冒险了。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陨星","speakerId":"char_219_meteo","isRemote":false,"text":"（太安静了。我们不知道敌人是什么样的感染者......）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陨星","speakerId":"char_219_meteo","isRemote":false,"text":"（如果有听力强化的那种，可就要遭殃了。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陨星","speakerId":"char_219_meteo","isRemote":false,"text":"（——他们在等什么？）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陨星","speakerId":"char_219_meteo","isRemote":false,"text":"（我感觉——很奇怪。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陨星","speakerId":"char_219_meteo","isRemote":false,"text":"（是不是——）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陨星","speakerId":"char_219_meteo","isRemote":false,"text":"（杰西卡，你有没有......）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰西卡","speakerId":"char_259_Jessica","isRemote":false,"text":"（我......我也......）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰西卡","speakerId":"char_259_Jessica","isRemote":false,"text":"（温度又下降了......）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰西卡","speakerId":"char_259_Jessica","isRemote":false,"text":"（我......好冷......）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陨星","speakerId":"char_219_meteo","isRemote":false,"text":"（难道就是他们......！）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陨星","speakerId":"char_219_meteo","isRemote":false,"text":"（——！杰西卡，你为什么咬住手指——）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霜叶","speakerId":"char_193_frostl","isRemote":false,"text":"（在防止牙齿因为打颤相碰而出声。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霜叶","speakerId":"char_193_frostl","isRemote":false,"text":"（先不说是否必要，但这种素养，真是厉害的孩子。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陨星","speakerId":"char_219_meteo","isRemote":false,"text":"（在我眼里，你也是孩子啊。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霜叶","speakerId":"char_193_frostl","isRemote":false,"text":"（——哈。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霜叶","speakerId":"char_193_frostl","isRemote":false,"text":"（不要。）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陨星","speakerId":"char_219_meteo","isRemote":false,"text":"（......回温了。那三个整合运动也离开了。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陨星","speakerId":"char_219_meteo","isRemote":false,"text":"是在测试什么东西的功能吗——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陨星","speakerId":"char_219_meteo","isRemote":false,"text":"——带着冰寒一声不响而来，带着温度默默离开，只留下受害者在暗处瑟瑟发抖。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陨星","speakerId":"char_219_meteo","isRemote":false,"text":"可恶，这些家伙，确实很像传说中的雪怪。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霜叶","speakerId":"char_193_frostl","isRemote":false,"text":"没准我蒙对了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霜叶","speakerId":"char_193_frostl","isRemote":false,"text":"也许他们就是雪怪。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霜叶","speakerId":"char_193_frostl","isRemote":false,"text":"......找到了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霜叶","speakerId":"char_193_frostl","isRemote":false,"text":"还是遭到冰封的墙体。但是，你们看——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陨星","speakerId":"char_219_meteo","isRemote":false,"text":"墙角掩埋着黑色的源石？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陨星","speakerId":"char_219_meteo","isRemote":false,"text":"果然。寒潮是从这个地点向外释放的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霜叶","speakerId":"char_193_frostl","isRemote":false,"text":"墙体上能看到鲜明的纹路。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霜叶","speakerId":"char_193_frostl","isRemote":false,"text":"这块源石就是区域降温的中心。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霜叶","speakerId":"char_193_frostl","isRemote":false,"text":"——我在做佣兵的时候，营房里流传过一阵这样一个传说。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霜叶","speakerId":"char_193_frostl","isRemote":false,"text":"乌萨斯西北域有一支感染者游击队，一直在与乌萨斯为敌。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霜叶","speakerId":"char_193_frostl","isRemote":false,"text":"他们中，有一个铁塔般的怪物。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霜叶","speakerId":"char_193_frostl","isRemote":false,"text":"据说，没有任何东西能阻止它前进。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霜叶","speakerId":"char_193_frostl","isRemote":false,"text":"盾牌会被挤压，武器会被折断。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霜叶","speakerId":"char_193_frostl","isRemote":false,"text":"那个怪物离开之后，留下的只有平地，灭绝了生机的平地。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霜叶","speakerId":"char_193_frostl","isRemote":false,"text":"而在那支游击队里，又有这样一支小队——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霜叶","speakerId":"char_193_frostl","isRemote":false,"text":"他们就像是寒冬。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霜叶","speakerId":"char_193_frostl","isRemote":false,"text":"他们走过的地方，全数冰结。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霜叶","speakerId":"char_193_frostl","isRemote":false,"text":"建筑轰然倒下，化作粉末，四散弥漫在空旷的战场。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霜叶","speakerId":"char_193_frostl","isRemote":false,"text":"而战壕中，躺满了被冻成冰块的乌萨斯士兵。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陨星","speakerId":"char_219_meteo","isRemote":false,"text":"你是觉得......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霜叶","speakerId":"char_193_frostl","isRemote":false,"text":"是的。我觉得他们就是那个传说。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霜叶","speakerId":"char_193_frostl","isRemote":false,"text":"——“雪怪小队”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霜叶","speakerId":"char_193_frostl","isRemote":false,"text":"前进吧。我想我们快要找到整合运动的据点了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰西卡","speakerId":"char_259_Jessica","isRemote":false,"text":"唔......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陨星","speakerId":"char_219_meteo","isRemote":false,"text":"怎么了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰西卡","speakerId":"char_259_Jessica","isRemote":false,"text":"你们有没有闻到一股......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰西卡","speakerId":"char_259_Jessica","isRemote":false,"text":"烧焦的味道？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null}],"observedOperators":[{"speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","aliases":["整合运动","整合运动成员"]},{"speakerId":"char_193_frostl","aliases":["霜叶"]},{"speakerId":"char_219_meteo","aliases":["陨星"]},{"speakerId":"char_259_Jessica","aliases":["杰西卡"]}]}
